'''Dogsville (Merciless)''' is the first stage in [[The Prince and the Revenant]]. After clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, the player can challenge the [[Continuation Stage]] [[Last of the Dead (Merciless) (Prince and Revenant)|Last of the Dead (Merciless)]].

