==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Everlord Wanwan]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 18.67~21.33 seconds<sup>560f~640f</sup>.
*7 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 32~36 seconds<sup>960f~1,080f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 18.67~21.33 seconds<sup>560f~640f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Between this and [[Last of the Dead (Merciless) (Prince and Revenant)|Last of the Dead]], Dogsville is absolutely the harder one, so have most of your lineup be suited for Wanwan. Options like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] should be included solely to ensure you don't accidentally die to Wanwan. Some units that can work in both stages include [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

