==Trivia==
*Dogsville's Japanese name, WANLAND, is likely a reference to the famous host and television personality [[wikipedia:Roland (Japanese host)|ROLAND]], as [[King Wahwah]]'s Japanese description mentions that [[Everlord Wanwan]] is also a host.

